  "content": "<div>\n<div>\n<p>這個附加功能提供了一些睡覺的額外好處。</p>\n<h2>特色<br><br></h2>\n<p><strong>睡覺治療傷害<br></strong>在床上睡覺將以可配置的數量恢復玩家。<br><br></p>\n<p><strong>藥水效果重置<br></strong>睡覺會治癒負面與正面的藥水效果。每個類型都可以在配置檔案中分別禁用<br><br><br></p>\n<p><strong>喜歡這個模組並想支持我？</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>在&nbsp;<a href=\"https://twitter.com/DarkhaxDev\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter</a>&nbsp;上跟隨我</li>\n<li>加入我的&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://discord.darkhax.net/\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></li>\n<li>在&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/Darkhax\" rel=\"nofollow\">Patreon</a>&nbsp;上支持我</li>\n<li>查看我的&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://darkhax.net/\" rel=\"nofollow\">網站</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://nodecraft.com/r/darkhax\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://nodecraft.com/assets/images/logo-dark.png\" width=\"384\" height=\"90\"></a><br>此專案由 Nodecraft 贊助。使用優惠碼&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://nodecraft.com/r/darkhax\" rel=\"nofollow\">Darkhax</a>&nbsp;享受首月服務 7 折!<img src=\"https://skulk.blmj.red/bed-benefits\" alt=\"\" width=\"1\" height=\"1\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>標誌由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fgame-icons.net%252f1x1%252fdelapouite%252fbed.html\" rel=\"nofollow\">Delapouite</a> 於 Game Icons 製作，並在 <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/linkout?remoteUrl=https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by/3.0/\" rel=\"nofollow\">CC By 3.0</a> 授權下釋出。</p>\n</div>\n</div>",
